+ * directory outside the prefix. Checks the dirList funcFixed receives for the four sort modes, the cut to dirListMax
+ * after the sort, the dirName a ListLoad2 falls back to when funcList picks nothing (the newest save), and the
+ * parameter error for sortType / sortOrder above 1.
+ *
+ * Built and run by tools/test_savedata_sort.py, which passes a scratch directory (the save root) as argv[1].
+ * -DSAVEDATA_SRC="path/cellSaveData.c" builds the same checks against another tree (negative control).
+ */
